{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57604","headline":"衆仙步虚词五首 五 · 无名氏","name":"衆仙步虚词五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香风飘羽盖，游气转飈车。\n泠泠上云路，窈窈入长虚。\n顾愍埃尘子，应运演灵书。\n妙果谐今日，㝠契自然符。\n（《云笈七签》卷九九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}